            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the shortest syntax possible that passes a single parameter, <code>seconds</code>, to an arrow function.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getConvertedHours = \" /><text value=\"seconds\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" seconds / \" /><text value=\"3600\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getConvertedHours(\" /><text value=\"7200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>seconds</code>.</p></body></html>"
